      "id": "translation-001",
      "startMs": 62430,
      "text": "云朵为什么会徜徉在天空"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation-002",
      "startMs": 66360,
      "text": "人们为什么要描绘梦想"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation-003",
      "startMs": 70670,
      "text": "或许这些都没有答案吧"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation-004",
      "startMs": 90070,
      "text": "虽然这一首小小的歌"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation-005",
      "startMs": 93900,
      "text": "你定会在未来某天忘记"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation-006",
      "startMs": 97820,
      "text": "但是我会一直记得哦"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation-007",
      "startMs": 102110,
      "text": "长大以后也会记得"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation-008",
      "startMs": 107640,
      "text": "今天我们要聊些什么话题？"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation-009",
      "startMs": 111690,
      "text": "要和你同唱怎样的歌曲？"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation-010",
      "startMs": 115660,
      "text": "还有仍无人知晓的花朵"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation-011",
      "startMs": 119440,
      "text": "全部 全部 全部"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation-012",
      "startMs": 122680,
      "text": "一起去找寻吧"
    },
    {
